  "contentHtml": "<p>재과만 선생님들이 추천해주신</p><p>&#39;미래를 파는 상점&#39;으로 1학기 독서수업을 하였습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>중3 과학 교과수업에서</p><p>과학독서활동( (매주 1시간) 으로 하였습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>4월</b></span></p><p>1. 학생수 만큼 도서 구입</p><p>2. 매주 독서 1시간씩 실시</p><p>3. 15개 챕터 중에서 관심있는 1개 챕터 선택</p><p>------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>5월</b></span></p><p>1. 매주 금요일 독서 1시간</p><p>2. 독서하면서 &#39;독서학습지&#39;에</p><p>&#160; &#160;각자 선택한 챕터에 요약, 문제, 답(해설) 작성하기</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7e06c990f0113332979df8e49e01b358f608542a?download\" data-file-name=\"독서학습지(미래를 파는 상점).hwp\" data-file-size=\"29696\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Df7qd%26dataid%3D32%26fileid%3D6%26regdt%3D20240719085507&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F7e06c990f0113332979df8e49e01b358f608542a')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">독서학습지(미래를 파는 상점)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">29.00KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>2. 컴퓨터실에서</p><p>&#160; 구글슬라이드에 나의 챕터 발표자료 만들기(2시간)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c82dd023ccb98bd1340b100a01fd364de9d8860e\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" height=\"238\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c82dd023ccb98bd1340b100a01fd364de9d8860e\" data-origin-width=\"1163\" data-origin-height=\"553\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d1257b8369a5d5baf9664cbcfd23708f5cfd208e\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" height=\"354\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d1257b8369a5d5baf9664cbcfd23708f5cfd208e\" data-origin-width=\"887\" data-origin-height=\"628\"></div><p>-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>6월</b></span></p><p>1. 내가 맡은 챕터 발표하기 (매시간 3~4명 발표 : 20분 정도)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/831ca49930bc241a0cbd313082c4e17b415faecf\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" height=\"261\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/831ca49930bc241a0cbd313082c4e17b415faecf\" data-origin-width=\"1214\" data-origin-height=\"633\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/50fbef624eff41013c57d0b7afc0e5606566943f\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" height=\"245\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/50fbef624eff41013c57d0b7afc0e5606566943f\" data-origin-width=\"1268\" data-origin-height=\"622\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f4e2d6805fc3f0aa8b193910ea2140d89710019\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" height=\"267\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f4e2d6805fc3f0aa8b193910ea2140d89710019\" data-origin-width=\"1205\" data-origin-height=\"643\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">2.&#160; 다른 챕터도 읽어보고, 문제 모음 학습지에 답하기</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;<span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>&#160; &#160; &#160;(1~15장까지 문제&amp;답 입니다.</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>&#160; &#160; &#160; </b></span><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>&#160;수정사항, 오답 제안해주시고,</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 더 좋은 문제 추가해주세요!)&#160;</b></span>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/639b6353e3b5aae893fd8955991986e7f5ec356a?download\" data-file-name=\"미래를 파는 상점 문제 모음.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"94311\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Df7qd%26dataid%3D32%26fileid%3D7%26regdt%3D20240719085507&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F639b6353e3b5aae893fd8955991986e7f5ec356a')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">미래를 파는 상점 문제 모음</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">92.10KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>7월 기말고사 다음주</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">1. 골든벨 리허설</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160; 종이나, 화이트보드를 사용하지 않고,</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160; 크롬북 &#39;그림판&#39; &amp; 펜을 이용하여 골든벨 대회 리허설</p><p>&#160;</p><p>2. 과학독서 골든벨 행사 운영</p><p>&#160; - 문제 모음 &amp; 독서학습지 에서 문제 출제</p><p>&#160; - 크롬북 그림판에 정답을 작성</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d9412169e1df76c19fe7fabdbdf6656667e227c8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d9412169e1df76c19fe7fabdbdf6656667e227c8\" data-origin-width=\"508\" data-origin-height=\"410\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
